text = "On a distant continent, there is a race called the Moon Octopus Clan. They are humanoid during the day, but at night, parts of their bodies transform into octopus tentacles, possessing the ability to freely swim in water. However, the power of the moon gradually weakened and the water level dropped. In order to resolve this drought crisis, the Moon Octopus Clan held a blessing ceremony, and finally the moon god responded to the wish by descending a magical conch with the power to summon tides."
